            "id": 2869015,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Now turn to section four. Section four. You will hear a lecturer on an environmental studies course discussing how birds are affected by environmental change. First, you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40. Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2869016,
